		"description": "<p>With intense focus and careful aim, you seek to inflict the maximum harm with minimal shots fired. Make a single ranged weapon attack as part of this action to strike a target within your weapon’s range. On a successful hit you deal double damage as if you had landed a critical hit. If you have three attacks from extra attack you instead deal triple damage. On a critical hit, all damage values are doubled.</p>",
